<title>SOUTH AFRICA: RM Props cautions on Randgold negotiations.</title>
<headline>RM Props cautions on Randgold negotiations.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>RMP Properties Ltd cautioned on Thursday that it was still involved in talks with Randgold &amp; Exploration Company Ltd over the purchase by Randgold of RMP's land clearing and gold recovery operation.</p>
<p>Shareholders were advised to continue to exercise caution in dealing in their RMP and Randgold shares until a further announcement was made.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
